{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29881","headline":"五月六日夜忆往岁秋与彻师同宿 · 李商隐","name":"五月六日夜忆往岁秋与彻师同宿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫阁相逢处，丹岩议宿时。\n堕蝉翻败叶，栖鸟定寒枝。\n万里飘流远，三年问讯迟。\n炎方忆初地，频梦碧琉璃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29881.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29881","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}